{
    "title": "iGun Pro 2: Realistic Gun Sim",
    "description": "Download the most realistic and comprehensive interactive gun game ever created! Virtually shoot the top weapons of the world and customize your weapons with attachments, camouflage patterns you can create, and entering those guns into global design contests. iGun Pro 2 is a game truly worthy of the iGun Pro Franchise!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2022\tCollect guns to build and upgrade your arsenal with a continually growing selection of firearms, including grenade launchers.\r\n\r\n\u2022      Battle other players in realtime on the FPS range. Test your skills and bring your best gun!\r\n\r\n\u2022\tBecome the ultimate gunsmith, creating the perfect weapon with a flexible attachment system that allows attachment nesting\r\n\r\n\u2022\tMake each gun genuinely unique with a mobile-optimized, touch-friendly painting system with customizable colors, patterns and version slots that allow for unlimited designs. Create a realistic or creative pattern; it is your choice.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tWin fame and get your design on the home screen by competing in design contests against iGun Pro 2 users around the world\r\n\r\n\u2022\tHigh-quality graphics for ultra-realistic simulation\r\n\r\n\u2022\tTeam up with your friends for exclusive rewards by creating and joining clans!\r\n\r\nThe app has an ever growing collection of guns which includes, rifles, pistols, handguns, machine guns, revolvers and rocket launchers as well. It features guns from many recent and historical wars such as WWI and WWII.\r\n\r\nThe App also works as a great reference app to your favorite 3rd party fps games!\r\n\r\nAdditional Information\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.crimson-moon.com/privacy.html\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: http://www.crimson-moon.com/terms_of_service.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the most realistic and comprehensive interactive gun game ever created! Virtually shoot the top weapons of the world and customize your weapons with attachments, camouflage patterns you can create, and entering those guns into global design contests. iGun Pro 2 is a game truly worthy of the iGun Pro Franchise!<br><br>FEATURES<br><br>\u2022\tCollect guns to build and upgrade your arsenal with a continually growing selection of firearms, including grenade launchers.<br><br>\u2022      Battle other players in realtime on the FPS range. Test your skills and bring your best gun!<br><br>\u2022\tBecome the ultimate gunsmith, creating the perfect weapon with a flexible attachment system that allows attachment nesting<br><br>\u2022\tMake each gun genuinely unique with a mobile-optimized, touch-friendly painting system with customizable colors, patterns and version slots that allow for unlimited designs. Create a realistic or creative pattern; it is your choice.<br><br>\u2022\tWin fame and get your design on the home screen by competing in design contests against iGun Pro 2 users around the world<br><br>\u2022\tHigh-quality graphics for ultra-realistic simulation<br><br>\u2022\tTeam up with your friends for exclusive rewards by creating and joining clans!<br><br>The app has an ever growing collection of guns which includes, rifles, pistols, handguns, machine guns, revolvers and rocket launchers as well. It features guns from many recent and historical wars such as WWI and WWII.<br><br>The App also works as a great reference app to your favorite 3rd party fps games!<br><br>Additional Information<br><br>Privacy Policy: http://www.crimson-moon.com/privacy.html<br><br>Terms of Service: http://www.crimson-moon.com/terms_of_service.html",
